'''Ziri''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Scarleton Bank}}. They give lost [[Crimson Isle]] [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contacts}}]] back.

== Purpose ==
'''Ziri''' can give the [[player]] [[Abiphone]] contacts for the following [[NPC]]s if the player has removed them:
* {{NPCSprite|Elle}}
* {{NPCSprite|Dean}}
* {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}}
* {{NPCSprite|Igrupan}}
* {{NPCSprite|Sirius}}
* {{NPCSprite|Feast Baker Scott}}
* {{NPCSprite|Feast Chef Ted}}

